<section class="why-us-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">WHY AKS AEROMODELS?</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">India's most trusted hub for precision RC engines, airframes, and flight equipment</p>

    <div class="features-grid">
      
      <div class="feature-item glass-panel">
        <div class="feature-icon">🛡️</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">100% GENUINE BRANDS</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Authorized distributor for Futaba, O.S. Engines, DLE, Seagull Aeromodels, & DU-BRO.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-item glass-panel">
        <div class="feature-icon">⚙️</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">PRECISION BALANCED</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Every balsa sheet, engine carb, and radio unit passes strict quality check protocols.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-item glass-panel">
        <div class="feature-icon">🚀</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">EXPRESS PAN-INDIA SHIPPING</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Specialized reinforced protective packaging for fragile balsa wood and ARF giant wings.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-item glass-panel">
        <div class="feature-icon">🎧</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">EXPERT FLIGHT SUPPORT</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Technical assistance by veteran aeromodelers for engine tuning, CG balance, and radio setup.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why-us-section {
    padding: 4.5rem 0;
    background: #08090c;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .feature-item {
    padding: 2.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    text-align: center;
    transition: var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .feature-item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(230, 200, 117, 0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }
  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .feature-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .feature-desc {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
